### 일촌 신청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/friends
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiverId": 2
}

### 일촌 수락
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/friends/1/accept
X-User-Id: 2

### 일촌 거절
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/friends/1/reject
X-User-Id: 2

### 일촌 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/friends
X-User-Id: 1

### 일촌 끊기
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/friends/1
X-User-Id: 1
